  "_comment": "Test order is random for both targets, and EmuquUITests runs serially because parallel simulator clones made it flaky. scripts/run_tests_with_coverage.sh (make test-coverage and CI) passes -parallel-testing-enabled NO unless PARALLEL_TESTING says otherwise, which overrides the parallel settings here."
